Copyright 2026 Holger Amann

Built against karoo-ext (Apache-2.0), copyright SRAM LLC.
https://github.com/hammerheadnav/karoo-ext

Battery levels, the saved sensor list and the head unit's charge are read from
the Karoo System through that library; the coarse battery vocabulary
(NEW/GOOD/OK/LOW/CRITICAL/INVALID) and its percentage thresholds are
karoo-ext's, used as facts about an interface rather than as copied source.

